{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-post-template-tsx","path":"/posts/vue/38_vuex_actions/","result":{"data":{"allMarkdownRemark":{"edges":[{"node":{"html":"<p>Vuex에서는 state를 수정할 때 mutations 함수를 만들어서 수정하라고 배워봤는데,<br>\n가끔 서버에서 데이터를 가져와서 수정하고 싶을 때가 있다.<br>\n그럴때 당연히 서버로 ajax 요청을 날리면 되는데<br>\n그런건 mutations에서 직접 하지 않고 actions라는 항목에 적어야 한다.</p>\n<p>왜나하면 mutations 함수들을 만들 때 내부에 ajax처럼 오래걸리는 코드를 작성하면<br>\n나중에 길게 코드짤 때 힘들어져서 그렇습니다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"javascript\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-javascript line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-javascript\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>store<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>js<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\r\n<span class=\"token operator\">...</span>\r\n<span class=\"token literal-property property\">actions</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n\t<span class=\"token comment\">// ajax나 오래걸리는 작업</span>\r\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\r\n<span class=\"token operator\">...</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<h2 id=\"더보기-게시물-ajax-요청하기\" style=\"position:relative;\">더보기 게시물 ajax 요청하기<a href=\"#%EB%8D%94%EB%B3%B4%EA%B8%B0-%EA%B2%8C%EC%8B%9C%EB%AC%BC-ajax-%EC%9A%94%EC%B2%AD%ED%95%98%EA%B8%B0\" aria-label=\"더보기 게시물 ajax 요청하기 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<p>시간이 소요되는 코드는 actions에 작성한다. (ex ajax)</p>\n<h3 id=\"step\" style=\"position:relative;\">step<a href=\"#step\" aria-label=\"step permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<ol>\n<li>actions 함수 작성</li>\n<li>mutation 함수 작성</li>\n<li>$store.dispatch(‘actions 함수’)</li>\n<li>actions함수에서 mutation함수를 이용해 state 변경</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"check-1\" style=\"position:relative;\">check 1<a href=\"#check-1\" aria-label=\"check 1 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>mutation 함수 실행 : $store.commit(‘함수명’, data)</li>\n<li>actions 함수 실행 : $store.dispatch(‘함수명’)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"check-2\" style=\"position:relative;\">check 2<a href=\"#check-2\" aria-label=\"check 2 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<p>state 수정은 mutation에서 한다</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"javascript\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-javascript line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-javascript\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>store<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>js<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\r\n\r\n<span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> createStore <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"vuex\"</span>\r\n<span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> axios <span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"token string\">'axios'</span>\r\n\r\n<span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> store <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token function\">createStore</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token function\">state</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n      <span class=\"token literal-property property\">likes</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span> <span class=\"token number\">36</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token number\">5</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\r\n      <span class=\"token literal-property property\">isLikes</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token boolean\">false</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">false</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">false</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\r\n      <span class=\"token literal-property property\">more</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token literal-property property\">mutations</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token function\">changeLikes</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token parameter\">state<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> data</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n      state<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>likes<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>data<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span> <span class=\"token operator\">+=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>state<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>isLikes<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>data<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">?</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token number\">1</span> <span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">1</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n      state<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>isLikes<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>data<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token operator\">!</span>state<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>isLikes<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>data<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token function\">LikesItemShift</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token parameter\">state</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n      state<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>likes<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">unshift</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n      state<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>isLikes<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">unshift</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token boolean\">false</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token function\">setMore</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token parameter\">state<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> data</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n      state<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>more<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">push</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>data<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token literal-property property\">actions</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token function\">getData</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token parameter\">context</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n      axios<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">get</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token template-string\"><span class=\"token template-punctuation string\">`</span><span class=\"token string\">https://codingapple1.github.io/vue/more0.json</span><span class=\"token template-punctuation string\">`</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\r\n      <span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">then</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span> <span class=\"token parameter\">result</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=></span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n        context<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">commit</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'setMore'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> result<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>data<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>   <span class=\"token comment\">// axios로 가져온 데이터를 mutations setMore을 이용해 저장한다. (저장을 바로 할 수 없기 때문에 commit문을 씀)</span>\r\n      <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\r\n      <span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">catch</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span> <span class=\"token parameter\">error</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n        console<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">log</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>error<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n      <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\r\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\r\n\r\n<span class=\"token keyword\">export</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">default</span> store<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"vue\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-vue line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-vue\">(App.vue)\r\n\r\n&lt;template&gt;\r\n  ...\r\n  &lt;p&gt;{{ $store.state.more }}&lt;/p&gt;\r\n  &lt;button @click=&quot;$store.dispatch(&#39;getData&#39;)&quot; type=&quot;button&quot; class=&quot;btn_more&quot; v-if=&quot;tab==0&quot;&gt;더보기&lt;/button&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;/template&gt;\r\n\r\n...</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>","tableOfContents":"<ul>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"#%EB%8D%94%EB%B3%B4%EA%B8%B0-%EA%B2%8C%EC%8B%9C%EB%AC%BC-ajax-%EC%9A%94%EC%B2%AD%ED%95%98%EA%B8%B0\">더보기 게시물 ajax 요청하기</a></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"#step\">step</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#check-1\">check 1</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#check-2\">check 2</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>","fields":{"gitLastModified":"Oct 2, 2026"},"frontmatter":{"title":"38. Vuex actions 게시물 더보기 버튼 (feat. ajax)","summary":"Vuex에서는 state를 수정할 때 mutations 함수를 만들어서 수정하라고 배워봤는데, 가끔 서버에서 데이터를 가져와서 수정하고 싶을 때가 있다. 그럴때 당연히 서버로 ajax 요청을 날리면 되는데 그런건 mutations에서 직접 하지 않고 actions라는 항목에 적어야 한다. 왜나하면","date":"Jul 26, 2023","categories":["VUE"],"tags":[],"author":["aluvy"],"thumbnail":null}}}]}},"pageContext":{"slug":"/posts/vue/38_vuex_actions/","prev":{"slug":"/posts/vue/37_인스타그램_좋아요_기능/","title":"37. Vuex를 이용한 인스타그램 좋아요 기능"},"next":{"slug":"/posts/css/safari-issue/","title":"[CSS] 사파리 overflow:hidden + border-radius 관련 이슈 해결법"}}},"staticQueryHashes":["1397594759","2043619371"],"slicesMap":{}}